  - elementId: m1-l1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [84, 1290, 912, 82]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      fontFamily: 更纱黑体
      color: "#383C43"
      lineHeight: 1.9
      text: |
        随时搞清楚三件事——我知道什么、AI 可能错在哪、这件事风险多大。也留意自己是不是被情绪、偏好或对 AI 的依赖带着走。然后按这些判断决定怎么做。
  - elementId: m1-l2-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [84, 1392, 200, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      fontFamily: 更纱黑体
      bold: true
      color: "#52678C"
      wrap: false
      text: 自检三句
  - elementId: m1-l2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [84, 1420, 912, 82]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      fontFamily: 更纱黑体
      color: "#383C43"
      lineHeight: 1.9
      text: |
        开口找 AI 之前，先对自己说清——我要什么、用来干什么、什么样算好。说不清？那就承认「我还没想清楚」，这不算丢人，跳过这一步才危险。
  - elementId: m1-l3-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [84, 1522, 200, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      fontFamily: 更纱黑体
      bold: true
      color: "#52678C"
      wrap: false
      text: 常见的坑
  - elementId: m1-b1-sq
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [86, 1562, 8, 8]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#52678C"}
  - elementId: m1-b1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [110, 1554, 886, 56]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      fontFamily: 更纱黑体
      color: "#383C43"
      lineHeight: 1.85
      text: |
        AI 答得顺，你就信了——无论觉得自己有几成把握，都问一句：支撑这个判断的证据够不够？重要结论要核对。
  - elementId: m1-b2-sq
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [86, 1628, 8, 8]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#52678C"}
  - elementId: m1-b2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [110, 1620, 886, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      fontFamily: 更纱黑体
      color: "#383C43"
      lineHeight: 1.85
      wrap: false
      text: 点了「确认」却说不清自己核了什么——把关的感觉有了，把关的动作没有。
  - elementId: m1-b3-sq
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [86, 1676, 8, 8]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#52678C"}
  - elementId: m1-b3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [110, 1668, 886, 82]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      fontFamily: 更纱黑体
      color: "#383C43"
      lineHeight: 1.85
      text: |
        哪天意识到「我最近好像什么都交给 AI 了」——这个瞬间很宝贵，记下来。顺手记下哪件事交给了哪个 AI、哪些判断仍由你做、最近实际分工有没有变。靠脑子是记不住的，用复盘表或清单。
  - elementId: m1-quote-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [84, 1772, 3, 56]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#B9C3D4"}
  - elementId: m1-quote
