  - elementId: m2-l1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [84, 2054, 912, 56]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      fontFamily: 更纱黑体
      color: "#383C43"
      lineHeight: 1.9
      text: |
        把一团模糊的事变成能分析、能验证的问题，然后用证据和逻辑得出结论，也敢推翻自己的结论。
  - elementId: m2-l2-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [84, 2130, 200, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      fontFamily: 更纱黑体
      bold: true
      color: "#52678C"
      wrap: false
      text: 平时长这样
  - elementId: m2-b1-sq
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [86, 2170, 8, 8]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#52678C"}
  - elementId: m2-b1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [110, 2162, 886, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      fontFamily: 更纱黑体
      color: "#383C43"
      lineHeight: 1.85
      wrap: false
      text: 先把问题本身问对——很多时候答案错了，是因为题目就错了。
  - elementId: m2-b2-sq
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [86, 2210, 8, 8]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#52678C"}
  - elementId: m2-b2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [110, 2202, 886, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      fontFamily: 更纱黑体
      color: "#383C43"
      lineHeight: 1.85
      wrap: false
      text: 分清「事实、推测、观点、立场」四样东西，AI 的回答里它们经常混在一起。
  - elementId: m2-b3-sq
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [86, 2250, 8, 8]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#52678C"}
  - elementId: m2-b3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [110, 2242, 886, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      fontFamily: 更纱黑体
      color: "#383C43"
      lineHeight: 1.85
      wrap: false
      text: 主动找反例：「这个结论在什么情况下不成立？」
  - elementId: m2-b4-sq
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [86, 2290, 8, 8]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#52678C"}
  - elementId: m2-b4
    elementType: text
    bounds: [110, 2282, 886, 56]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      fontFamily: 更纱黑体
      color: "#383C43"
      lineHeight: 1.85
      text: |
        方案不止一个时，摆开来比一比——比如省时间和保隐私都重要，别假装两者没有冲突，明说这个冲突再选。
  - elementId: m2-b5-sq
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [86, 2356, 8, 8]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#52678C"}
  - elementId: m2-b5
    elementType: text
    bounds: [110, 2348, 886, 82]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      fontFamily: 更纱黑体
      color: "#383C43"
      lineHeight: 1.85
      text: |
        AI 给了断言，让它给证据；它列出的来源也要自己核对，尤其是会影响你决定的说法。让 AI 摘要或转述时，也要对照原文看有没有漏掉关键内容。
  - elementId: m2-b6-sq
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [86, 2448, 8, 8]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#52678C"}
  - elementId: m2-b6
    elementType: text
    bounds: [110, 2440, 886, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      fontFamily: 更纱黑体
      color: "#383C43"
      lineHeight: 1.85
      wrap: false
      text: 交出去之前，先定好「怎样算过关」，而不是看到结果再说「还行」。
